{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55629","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十七 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"投足烟峦养病躯，驰求终是用工夫。\n千般有作皆从智，万种无依自合愚。\n意地已抛尘事业，心田唯种稻根株。\n非时免见干人世，野食山袍自有谟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}